Package: simpexp
Title: Simulate Event Histories from Piecewise Exponential Hazards
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Andreas", "Bender", , "bender.at.R@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5628-8611"))
  )
Description: Simulates single-event, competing-risks and multi-state event
    histories from hazards that are piecewise constant on a user-supplied time
    grid. Each transition is specified by a formula for its log-hazard, which
    may use the time scales and history features that the simulator maintains,
    so that non-Markov processes can be specified directly. Because the hazards
    are piecewise constant by construction, waiting times are drawn by exact
    inversion of the cumulative hazard rather than by numerical approximation.
